      "instruction": "Sign in to Odoo: on the login page at http://127.0.0.1:8069/web/login, type admin into the Email/Login field, type the literal text {{env:APP_PASSWORD}} into the Password field (it is filled in automatically when typed - do not guess or alter it), and click the Log in button. Wait for the Odoo apps/home page to load (do not wait for network idle - the app long-polls; wait for a concrete element like the apps menu or user menu). Report what page you land on and confirm you are logged in as admin.",
      "skill": "s_906fa0",
      "params": {
        "v1": "{{env:APP_PASSWORD}}"
      },
      "outputs": [
